# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pipeline is exactly what [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\") assembles, so reach for the preset in practice and build the stages by hand when you need to change one of them:\n"
msgstr "이 파이프라인은 [`generate_preset_jw_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-presets-generate-preset-jw-pass-manager#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.presets.generate_preset_jw_pass_manager\")가 조립하는 것과 정확히 같으므로, 실제로는 프리셋을 사용하고 단계 중 하나를 바꿔야 할 때 직접 단계를 구성하세요.\n"

